> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T18:03:41-07:00","id":182413,"title":"","content":"AW, I should have thought of Hell on Wheels.<br /> <br /> By the way, yes, Demon car is the best thing <i>ever</i>.<br /> <br /> Conspiracy theory about a conspiracy: the Client for the Knights of Saint Adrian is not an angel or even the God-Machine, but an Integrator with Tattoo Gadgets and a crazy plan to get back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T18:05:03-07:00","id":182415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> 